		{"id":"70b49f305f283af5","type":"text","text":"工具优化","x":-1920,"y":90,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2f1d9c68f02c2afd","type":"text","text":"记忆优化","x":-1920,"y":182,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"37693b1bb189d0fc","type":"text","text":"性能评估","x":-1920,"y":274,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3da65e98adf98033","type":"text","text":"准确性评估","x":-1920,"y":366,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"81e0b39ec36bcc2a","type":"text","text":"API 服务","x":-1920,"y":458,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"6050b9df736d9415","type":"text","text":"Web 应用集成","x":-1920,"y":550,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0e7f42155e5e4307","type":"text","text":"Agent 分工","x":-1920,"y":-462,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4156b60bfdba71a7","type":"text","text":"角色定义","x":-1920,"y":-370,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"089f6082cf78551e","type":"text","text":"日志记录","x":-1920,"y":-1014,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c5451450a321bb21","type":"text","text":"错误处理","x":-1920,"y":-922,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5741dfba113bde34","type":"text","text":"Prompt 优化","x":-1920,"y":-830,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1d72c4c858f036dd","type":"text","text":"性能优化","x":-1920,"y":-738,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c208d5edd1e87d0e","type":"text","text":"协作模式","x":-1920,"y":-646,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c55e8505c7b0878b","type":"text","text":"通信机制","x":-1920,"y":-554,"width":250,"height":60},
		{
			"id":"23b81b2477036a23",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"在探索任何一个复杂概念时，我们最好从一个简洁的定义开始。在人工智能领域，智能体被定义为任何能够通过**传感器（Sensors）**感知其所处**环境（Environment）**，并**自主**地通过**执行器（Actuators）**采取**行动（Action）**以达成特定目标的实体。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1620,
			"y":23,
			"width":520,
			"height":138
		},
		{
			"id":"7e2e5a9e002c6de7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Hello-Agents\nhttps://hello-agents.datawhale.cc/#/./README",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":640,
			"y":720,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"793e918d1d133a67",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"基于内部决策结构的分类",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3040,
			"y":-340,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"ed993defeacfde8e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"基于时间与反应性的分类",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3040,
			"y":-160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"030dfd5e32cf81ae","type":"text","text":"反应式智能体:恒温器,简单游戏NPC","x":3382,"y":-251,"width":260,"height":60},
		{
			"id":"e0dea6967ac714ed",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"规划式智能体:AlphaGo, 物流路径规划系统",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3382,
			"y":-160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"0a83a55e1996208c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"混合式智能体: 自动驾驶汽车",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3380,
			"y":-70,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"401bbfbdbbb2a93a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"反应式->模型式->基于目标和基于效用",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3380,
			"y":-340,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"6886dc3aaad87635",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"符号主义AI (Symbolic AI)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3380,
			"y":130,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"49237ed8701f934a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"亚符号主义AI(Sub-symbolic AI)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3380,
			"y":20,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"8dbaa9c9935728d2",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"神经符号主义AI (Neuro-Symbolic AI)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3380,
			"y":230,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"806fa85cc909f010",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"基于知识表示的分类",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3040,
			"y":130,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"05c81c96ae54e6d1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"智能体类型",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2700,
			"y":-160,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"fd5516c9a7fce2e3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"要理解智能体的运作，我们必须先理解它所处的**任务环境**。在人工智能领域，通常使用**PEAS 模型**来精确描述一个任务环境，即分析其**性能度量(Performance)、环境(Environment)、执行器(Actuators)和传感器(Sensors)** 。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1620,
			"y":237,
			"width":480,
			"height":122
		},
		{"id":"95704090f5d8bd6e","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261110095138.png","x":1335,"y":161,"width":400,"height":69},
		{"id":"dcb7ec6936e3e33f","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261110095200.png","x":2180,"y":421,"width":400,"height":122},
		{
			"id":"d36c7fb3104df4c9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"这是循环的起点。智能体通过其传感器（例如，API 的监听端口、用户输入接口）接收来自环境的输入信息。这些信息，即**观察 (Observation)**，既可以是用户的初始指令，也可以是上一步行动所导致的环境状态变化反馈。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2660,
			"y":-12,
			"width":280,
			"height":125
		},
		{
			"id":"07f16486df4dfdfa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"接收到观察信息后，智能体进入其核心决策阶段。对于 LLM 智能体而言，这通常是由大语言模型驱动的内部推理过程。如图所示，“思考”阶段可进一步细分为两个关键环节：\n\n- **规划 (Planning)**：智能体基于当前的观察和其内部记忆，更新对任务和环境的理解，并制定或调整一个行动计划。这可能涉及将复杂目标分解为一系列更具体的子任务。\n- **工具选择 (Tool Selection)**：根据当前计划，智能体从其可用的工具库中，选择最适合执行下一步骤的工具，并确定调用该工具所需的具体参数。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2660,
			"y":130,
			"width":260,
			"height":130
		},
		{
			"id":"8a7889f1cbd6af3a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"决策完成后，智能体通过其执行器（Actuators）执行具体的行动。这通常表现为调用一个选定的工具（如代码解释器、搜索引擎 API），从而对环境施加影响，意图改变环境的状态。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2660,
			"y":300,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"43b3d7c2419dab99",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"workflow和agent的区别",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2100,
			"y":580,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"cd1830a3ad1588c0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Workflow 是让 AI 按部就班地执行指令，而 Agent 则是赋予 AI 自由度去自主达成目标**。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2400,
			"y":580,
			"width":400,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"5ba5cac174d3550c","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261110100434.png","x":2840,"y":420,"width":400,"height":275},
		{
			"id":"403e99ed0b11366d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"基于大型语言模型的智能体是一个**具备自主性的、以目标为导向的系统**。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3340,
			"y":580,
			"width":300,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"9b84a1d932a794b6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"工作流是一种传统的自动化范式，其核心是**对一系列任务或步骤进行预先定义的、结构化的编排**。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3340,
			"y":420,
			"width":300,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"218ec86b23837320",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"规划与工具调用",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3740,
			"y":520,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"d1b4bef3c55a77cc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"推理与决策",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3740,
			"y":600,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"17627ec7ce47ac50",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"生成结果",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":3740,
			"y":680,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2c04f06d8ab848df",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**这种基于实时信息进行动态推理和决策的能力，正是 Agent 的核心价值所在。**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4060,
			"y":580,
			"width":280,
			"height":100
		},
		{"id":"d8b19b288400a0be","type":"text","text":"工具调用 Tool Calling","x":1220,"y":1812,"width":250,"height":60},
		{
			"id":"ae063a653847cbd6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"A2A (Google 25年)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2360,
			"y":1520,
			"width":250,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"64630ae1b62030f5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"MCP (Anthropic 24年)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2360,
			"y":1612,
			"width":250,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"18146e4e7ab58f8f","type":"text","text":"Function Calling (openai 23年)","x":2360,"y":1685,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"bc2c4cbbafae91dc","type":"text","text":"工具定义和描述","x":2360,"y":1777,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"590f10bd58f0a5ad","type":"text","text":"工具参数解析","x":2360,"y":1869,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"99b7f53c7081d0c7","type":"text","text":"工具执行和结果返回","x":2360,"y":1961,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b474f6030f85191d","type":"text","text":"Plan and Execute","x":1790,"y":1132,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"cfc6287a060c5770","type":"text","text":"Reflection","x":1790,"y":1224,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f932707e6e47b2c0","type":"text","text":"Multi-Agent","x":1790,"y":1316,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9d3047a1c702d7d3","type":"text","text":"Agent 架构模式","x":1220,"y":1178,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0a7fa5f1565009c5","type":"text","text":"ReAct","x":1790,"y":1040,"width":250,"height":60},
		{
			"id":"0cd4d1028977f0bb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"一个形象的比喻是：**Function Calling解决“手怎么用”，MCP解决“工具怎么标准化”，而A2A解决“人怎么协作”**。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1925,
			"y":1594,
			"width":350,
			"height":96
		},
		{"id":"80c33bfb5ca98cd2","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261110102718.png","x":640,"y":446,"width":400,"height":189},
		{
			"id":"dd8d93949c78efa3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"机器能力演进:\n执行程序->理解语言->自主决策->围绕目标完成任务",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":0,
			"y":40,
			"width":260,
			"height":120
		},
		{"id":"f604ab5dafa469df","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261113095829.png","x":1460,"y":740,"width":444,"height":250},
		{
			"id":"1b60a70e6851c6f6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Thought-Action-Observation",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1205,
			"y":680,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"e07e5668d7e8a2ce",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Agent = LLM + Harness\nLLM            Harness\n理解任务 +     Tool Context AgentLoop   Runtime\n自主决策     工具调用 上下文管理 执行循环 记忆 运行环境\n\n在此之上扩展 Memory RAG Skill 历史经验 外部知识 专业能力\n另一种概括: Agent = LLM + Tools + Memory + Planning\n把理解与决策转化为实际行动, 完成用户交给它的任务",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null
			},
			"x":1200,
			"y":451,
			"width":500,
			"height":229
		},
		{
			"id":"4c524204fa6f6d5e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**理解目标 → 决策行动 → 执行工具 → 观察结果 → 调整决策 → 完成任务**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1900,
			"y":960,
			"width":650,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"651c31d1db4947fd","type":"file","file":"image/Pasted image 20261113100556.png","x":2260,"y":695,"width":490,"height":245},
		{
			"id":"e88d192ec78c6469",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"|维度|Sandbox（沙箱）|虚拟机 VM|Docker 容器|\n|---|---|---|---|\n|**本质**|一种**安全/隔离理念**，不是单一技术|用 Hypervisor 虚拟出完整硬件，运行独立 OS|用 Linux namespace/cgroups 等隔离进程，共享宿主内核|\n|**隔离级别**|可高可低，取决于实现|**硬件级/强隔离**|**进程级/OS 级隔离**，较弱|\n|**包含什么**|可能是进程沙箱、浏览器沙箱、VM、容器、seccomp 等|完整 Guest OS + 应用|应用 + 依赖库，不含完整 OS 内核|\n|**启动速度**|看实现|慢，通常数十秒到分钟|快，通常毫秒到秒级|\n|**资源开销**|看实现|大，每个 VM 有独立 OS 开销|小，共享内核，镜像分层|\n|**安全边界**|目标是限制不可信代码行为|强边界，适合多租户/不可信负载|**默认不是强安全边界**，需加固|\n|**典型工具**|seccomp、gVisor、Firecracker、浏览器沙箱、WASM 沙箱|VMware、KVM、VirtualBox、Hyper-V|Docker、containerd、Podman|\n|**常见场景**|运行不可信代码、插件、AI 代码执行、浏览器标签页|多租户云、强隔离、异构 OS、遗留系统|微服务、CI/CD、应用打包、快速部署|",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":680,
			"y":1440,
			"width":500,
			"height":320
		},
		{
			"id":"2a5fdfd9abf08247",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Sandbox",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1400,
			"y":1700,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"ac7faed6d00400a9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"虚拟机VM: 有完整的应用程序和操作系统内核\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1400,
			"y":1392,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"8bd401928cf9a63a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Docker容器: 在虚拟操作系统上给定 (依赖库和配置) 形成独立的环境 (容器化)\n只适合风险相对可控的方案, 一旦出现容器逃逸,会影响操作系统",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1400,
			"y":1482,
			"width":260,
			"height":190
		},
